{"id":"t983311","key":"mu zhong wuren|2022","csv":{"title":"Mù zhōng Wúrén","year":2022,"directors":["Yáng Bǐng-Jiā"],"rating":5,"watchedDate":"2026-08-06"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":983311,"imdbId":"tt21318724","wikidataId":"Q123354361","title":"Eye for an Eye","originalTitle":"目中无人","altTitles":["A Blind Hero","Mu Zhong Wu Ren","Up Your Nose","Blind Sword","Defiant","ยอดกระบี่ไร้เทียมทาน","Eye for an Eye","Eye for an Eye: The Blind Swordsman","Слепой меч","Непокорный"],"tagline":"","overview":"Devenu aveugle, un épéiste aux talents extraordinaires commence à errer dans le pays. Lorsqu’il rencontre Ni Yan, une viticultrice qui a été humiliée et dont la vie a été détruite, il se jure de ne pas intervenir. Mais au fur et à mesure qu’il est impliqué dans un sombre conflit, l’aveugle est forcé de s’engager sur la voie de la justice vengeresse et sa véritable identité est révélée.","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"2022-09-10","runtime":77,"status":"Released","genres":["Action","Drame"],"genreIds":[28,18],"countries":["China"],"originCountry":["CN"],"languages":["普通话"],"originalLanguage":"zh","directors":["杨秉佳"],"directorIds":[3242539],"writers":["杨秉佳"],"composers":[],"cinematographers":["赵晓峰"],"editors":["王纪清"],"producers":["魏君子","Ma Ye"],"cast":[{"id":83487,"name":"Miao Xie","character":"Cheng Xiazi","profilePath":"/fpuwLIVATZzqfnjR749rJkyQTLA.jpg"},{"id":2580771,"name":"Gao Weiman","character":"Ni Yan","profilePath":"/4n8XToC5mCFiEryIfy2qr2gEfEj.jpg"},{"id":1758675,"name":"向皓","character":"Yuwen Ying","profilePath":"/jK2ZdT9jkbH0nTjh0UqEAWSlmln.jpg"},{"id":2765300,"name":"Liu Ben","character":"He Qufeng","profilePath":"/v32cIOWmaTZCZAudnspC1eSOvIz.jpg"},{"id":3148229,"name":"张荻","character":"Qin Niang","profilePath":"/h3xpbfvPCUMrrITE881qSIkE0ft.jpg"},{"id":3041335,"name":"高毅","character":"Gao Fei","profilePath":"/ioOeGt0Yq4kmX4B6xOxgN6OSPfu.jpg"},{"id":2517052,"name":"张皓森","character":"Ni Jun","profilePath":null},{"id":2377112,"name":"康轩","character":"Hei Jiao